     A*  QWSSYSRQ: the System Request menu, shown by the job when
     A*  Sys Req is pressed. SYSRQ is the menu of a job alone on its
     A*  display; SYSRQ2 adds the group and secondary job options:
     A*  13 and 14 under indicator 51 (a group job), 15 under 52 (a
     A*  secondary job waits).
     A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
     A                                      CA03(03)
     A                                      CA12(12)
     A                                      HELP
     A          R SYSRQ
     A                                  1 34'System Request'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  2 62'System:'
     A            SYSNAME        8A  O  2 72
     A                                  3  2'Select one of the following:'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                  5  7'1.'
     A                                  5 10'Display sign on for secondary job'
     A                                  6  7'2.'
     A                                  6 10'End previous request'
     A                                  7  7'3.'
     A                                  7 10'Display current job'
     A                                  8  7'4.'
     A                                  8 10'Display messages'
     A                                  9  7'5.'
     A                                  9 10'Send a message'
     A                                 10  7'6.'
     A                                 10 10'Display system operator messages'
     A                                 11  7'7.'
     A                                 11 10'Display work station user'
     A                                 13  6'80.'
     A                                 13 10'Disconnect job'
     A                                 15  6'90.'
     A                                 15 10'Sign off'
     A                                 18 74'Bottom'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                 19  2'Selection'
     A            SEL            2A  I 20  7DSPATR(UL)
     A                                 22  2'F3=Exit   F12=Cancel'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                 23  2'(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A          R SYSRQ2
     A                                  1 34'System Request'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  2 62'System:'
     A            SYSNAME        8A  O  2 72
     A                                  3  2'Select one of the following:'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                  5  7'1.'
     A                                  5 10'Display sign on for secondary job'
     A                                  6  7'2.'
     A                                  6 10'End previous request'
     A                                  7  7'3.'
     A                                  7 10'Display current job'
     A                                  8  7'4.'
     A                                  8 10'Display messages'
     A                                  9  7'5.'
     A                                  9 10'Send a message'
     A                                 10  7'6.'
     A                                 10 10'Display system operator messages'
     A                                 11  7'7.'
     A                                 11 10'Display work station user'
     A  51                             12  6'13.'
     A  51                             12 10'Transfer to group job'
     A  51                             13  6'14.'
     A  51                             13 10'Transfer to previous group job'
     A  52                             14  6'15.'
     A  52                             14 10'Transfer to secondary job'
     A                                 16  6'80.'
     A                                 16 10'Disconnect job'
     A                                 17  6'90.'
     A                                 17 10'Sign off'
     A                                 18 74'Bottom'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                 19  2'Selection'
     A            SEL            2A  I 20  7DSPATR(UL)
     A                                 22  2'F3=Exit   F12=Cancel'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A                                 23  2'(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
